    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Hospital has added the most modern treatment for haemorrhoids called the Procedure for Prolapse and Haemorrhoids (PPH) to its existing facilities. In this regard, visiting Indian expert Dr Roysuneel V Patankar delivered a presentation on the latest method of haemorrhoidectomy at a seminar on piles arranged by Aga Khan University on June 1.",
